    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS ACCOUNTING LAW",
    "describe_ch": "本法學習會計人員及主管之法律責任，會計原則之法律優先運用範圍",
    "describe_eh": "The course learn the responsibility of accountant and priority of GAAP",
    "pre_subname": "ACCT1011會計學(一)、ACCT1012會計學(二)",
